', 'STH', 'STX', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TOR', 'TPR', 'TSB', 'TSP', 'UDS', 'UGL', 'ULG', 'UMA', 'UND', 'UNF', 'UNH', 'USG', 'UST', 'V09', 'V13', 'VIS', 'VMA', 'VOW', 'W16', 'W17', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOE', 'WTH', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['Add o\\nBo\\nBo\\nB to your mana pool.', 'As Quirion Elves comes into play, choose a color.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Add one mana of the chosen color to your mana pool.', 'As an additional cost to play Sonic Burst, discard a card at random from your hand.\\nSonic Burst deals 4 damage to target creature or player.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, target non—\\nWall creature an opponent controls gains forestwalk until your next upkeep. (The creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls a forest.)', 'B', 'Bloodrock Cyclops attacks each turn if able.', 'Choose one Thunderbolt deals 3 damage to target player; or Thunderbolt deals 4 damage to target creature with flying.', "Clockwork Avian comes into play with four +1/+0 counters on it.\\nClockwork Avian can't have more than four +1/+0 counters on it.\\nAt end of combat, if Clockwork Avian attacked or blocked this turn, remove a +1/+0 counter from it.\\no\\nX, oc\\nT: Put X +1/+0 counters on Clockwork Avian. Play this ability only during your upkeep.", "Clockwork Beast comes into play with seven +1/+0 counters on it.\\nClockwork Beast can't have more than seven +1/+0 counters on it.\\nAt end of combat, if Clockwork Beast attacked or blocked this turn, remove a +1/+0 counter from it.\\no\\nX, oc\\nT: Put X +1/+0 counters on Clockwork Beast. Play this ability only during your upkeep.", "Counter target spell unless its controller pays o\\nX. If he or she doesn't, that player taps all lands he or she controls and empties his or her mana pool.", 'Counter target spell.', 'Cycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability any time you could play an instant.)\\nPolluted Mire comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nB to your mana pool.', 'Cycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability any time you could play an instant.)\\nRemote Isle comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nU to your mana pool.', 'Cycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability any time you could play an instant.)\\nSlippery Karst comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool.', 'Cycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability any time you could play an instant.)\\nSmoldering Crater comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nR to your mana pool.', "Deadly Insect can't be the target of spells or abilities.", "Destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target tapped creature.', 'Discard your hand, then draw that many cards.', 'Draw three cards, then put two cards from your hand on top of your library in any order.', 'Dwarven Ruins comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nR to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT, Sacrifice Dwarven Ruins: Add o\\nRo\\nR to your mana pool.', 'Ebon Stronghold comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nB to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT, Sacrifice Ebon Stronghold: Add o\\nBo\\nB to your mana pool.', 'Fireball deals X damage divided evenly, rounded down, among Y plus one target creatures and/or players.', 'Flying', 'Flying\\nCloud Djinn can block only creatures with flying.', 'Flying\\nCloud Elemental can block only creatures with flying.', 'Flying\\nSacrifice a creature: Fallen Angel gets +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhen Fog Elemental attacks or blocks, sacrifice it at end of combat.', 'Flying\\nWhen you play a creature spell, sacrifice Skittering Skirge.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Sengir Vampire this turn is put into a graveyard, put a +1/+1 counter on Sengir Vampire.', 'Flying\\no2oo\\nU Untap Vigilant Drake.', 'Flying\\no3oo\\nU Untap Blizzard Elemental.', 'Flying\\noo\\nR Shivan Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Flying\\noo\\nU Put Wayward Soul on top of its owner's library.", 'G', 'Haste (This creature may attack and oc\\nT the turn it comes under your control.)', 'Havenwood Battleground comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT, Sacrifice Havenwood Battleground: Add o\\nGo\\nG to your mana pool.', "Hulking Cyclops can't block.", 'Kird Ape gets +1/+2 as long as you control a forest.', 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player.', 'Lightning Bolt deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', "Look at target opponent's hand and choose a card from it. That player discards that card.", 'Look at the top five cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on top of your library in any order.', 'Look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library.', 'Plated Spider may block as though it had flying.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by enchanted creature.', "Put any number of target creature cards from your graveyard on top of your library.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", 'R', 'Search your library for a basic land card and put that card into play tapped. Then shuffle your library.', 'Shock deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', "Spend only black mana on o\\nX.\\nDrain Life deals X damage to target creature or player. You gain life equal to the damage dealt, but not more life than the player's life total before Drain Life dealt damage or the creature's toughness.", 'Svyelunite Temple comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nU to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT, Sacrifice Svyelunite Temple: Add o\\nUo\\nU to your mana pool.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target player sacrifices a creature.', 'Trample', 'Trample; haste (This creature may attack and oc\\nT the turn it comes under your control.)\\nAt end of turn, sacrifice Ball Lightning.', 'Trample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, Force of Nature deals 8 damage to you unless you pay o\\nGo\\nGo\\nGo\\nG.', "Trample\\nLeviathan comes into play tapped and doesn't untap during your untap step.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice two islands. If you do, untap Leviathan.\\nLeviathan can't attack unless you sacrifice two islands.", 'U', 'When Balduvian Horde comes into play, sacrifice it unless you discard a card at random from your hand.', 'When Gravedigger comes into play, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Tar Pit Warrior becomes the target of a spell or ability, sacrifice Tar Pit Warrior.', 'When you play a creature spell, sacrifice Skittering Horror.', 'Whenever Crashing Boars attacks, defending player chooses an untapped creature he or she controls. That creature blocks Crashing Boars this turn if able.', 'Whenever Hollow Dogs attacks, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Segmented Wurm becomes the target of a spell or ability, put a -1/-1 counter on it.', 'Whenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds o\\nG to his or her mana pool.', 'Woolly Spider may block as though it had flying.\\nWhenever Woolly Spider blocks a creature with flying, Woolly Spider gets +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'o\\nRoo\\nG Shambling Strider gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool.', "oo\\nU Giant Crab can't be the target of spells or abilities this turn.", 'oo\\nU Killer Whale gains flying until end of turn.']
